# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in your key. `.env` is git-ignored.
#
# NorthStar reads this file at startup. With a key present, the app researches
# local rental policy automatically for any address that has no note yet, and
# saves the result under knowledge_bank/researched/zips/<zip>/.
#
# Without a key the app still runs end to end - the financial model, the policy
# data, and your own notes in knowledge_bank/user/ are all fully offline. You
# just get the copy-and-paste research prompt instead of automatic research.
#
# Get a key at https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
# Each new address costs roughly one Opus request with web search. A researched
# note is written once and then reused, so the same ZIP is never re-billed.

ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Set to 1 to force the original fully-offline behaviour even when a key exists
# (useful for demos with no wifi, and set automatically during tests).
# NORTHSTAR_DISABLE_AUTO_RESEARCH=1
